# Generated pages — built from content/*.json by build.py.
# Not committed on purpose: the admin commits JSON only, so a committed copy
# of these would go stale the moment anyone edits content. Cloudflare Pages
# renders them at deploy time; run `python build.py` for a local copy.
/index.html
/music.html
/videos.html
/about.html
/press.html
/zh/*.html
/dist/

# asset pipeline scratch (regenerate with tools/*.py)
/images/
/web/
ink_raw.png
ink_preview.png

# Two tracks are committed, not the ten that sit here locally: the rest
# are unconfirmed for public release, and at 25MB they were most of the
# repo. weifeng (Overthinking, hue 322 magenta) and little_star (singles,
# hue 210 ice) - 5.2MB together, and far enough apart on the wheel that
# skipping between them visibly regrades the hero.
#
# Saturn Diary has no track here any more, so the lighting never goes
# amber on the deployed site. Add pozhen back below if that matters.
#
# Nothing else needs to change to add or drop one: AudioEngine._init()
# HEAD-probes every entry in the playlist and keeps the ones that answer,
# so content/shared.json can keep listing all ten.
/audio/*
!/audio/README.md
!/audio/weifeng.mp3
!/audio/little_star_music.mp3

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
__pycache__/
